OL,3,APhilippine police obtain warrant to
OL,4,Asearch Thomas Markle's devices
OL,5,
OL,6,FPhilippine police have obtained a
OL,7,Fwarrant to examine devices allegedly
OL,8,Fremoved from the former home of Thomas
OL,9,FMarkle, father of the Duchess of
OL,10,FSussex.
OL,12,FEarlier this month, it was reported
OL,13,Fthat hundreds of images of child sexual
OL,14,Fabuse allegedly belonging to Thomas
OL,15,FMarkle Sr, 82, had been found at the
OL,16,Fproperty in the Philippines.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
